[2026-03-14T19:34:05.746Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ArUEbQDKu6a2Yop6LvTi5B","type":"tool_result","content":"   158→\n   159→### AirportAutocomplete\n   160→\n   161→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete origin field shows placeholder text\n   162→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   163→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with empty origin field\n   164→- **Action**: User observes the origin airport field\n   165→- **Expected**: The field displays placeholder text indicating the user should enter an origin (e.g., \"Where from?\").\n   166→\n   167→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete destination field shows placeholder text\n   168→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   169→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with empty destination field\n   170→- **Action**: User observes the destination airport field\n   171→- **Expected**: The field displays placeholder text indicating the user should enter a destination (e.g., \"Where to?\").\n   172→\n   173→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing airport name\n   174→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   175→- **Initial state**: Origin field is focused and empty\n   176→- **Action**: User types \"Los Angeles\" into the origin field\n   177→- **Expected**: A suggestion dropdown appears showing matching airports, including \"Los Angeles International Airport (LAX)\". Each suggestion shows the airport name and IATA code.\n   178→\n   179→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing IATA code\n   180→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   181→- **Initial state**: Origin field is focused and empty\n   182→- **Action**: User types \"JFK\" into the origin field\n   183→- **Expected**: A suggestion dropdown appears showing \"John F. Kennedy International Airport (JFK)\" as a match.\n   184→\n   185→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing city name\n   186→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   187→- **Initial state**: Destination field is focused and empty\n   188→- **Action**: User types \"London\" into the destination field\n   189→- **Expected**: A suggestion dropdown appears showing London-area airports (e.g., \"London Heathrow (LHR)\").\n   190→\n   191→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete selects a suggestion and populates the field\n   192→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   193→- **Initial state**: User has typed \"Los\" in the origin field, suggestions are visible\n   194→- **Action**: User clicks on \"Los Angeles International Airport (LAX)\" from the suggestions\n   195→- **Expected**: The origin field is populated with the selected airport (showing name and/or code). The suggestion dropdown closes.\n   196→\n   197→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete swap button exchanges origin and destination\n   198→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   199→- **Initial state**: Origin is set to \"LAX\" and destination is set to \"JFK\"\n   200→- **Action**: User clicks the swap button between origin and destination fields\n   201→- **Expected**: Origin becomes \"JFK\" and destination becomes \"LAX\". Both fields update their displayed values.\n   202→\n   203→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete swap button works with empty fields\n   204→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   205→- **Initial state**: Origin is set to \"LAX\", destination is empty\n   206→- **Action**: User clicks the swap button\n   207→- **Expected**: Origin becomes empty, destination becomes \"LAX\".\n   208→\n   209→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete clears field and shows new suggestions\n   210→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   211→- **Initial state**: Origin field has \"LAX\" selected\n   212→- **Action**: User clears the origin field and types \"San\"\n   213→- **Expected**: The field clears the previous selection. New suggestions appear for airports matching \"San\" (e.g., \"San Francisco International Airport (SFO)\", \"San Diego International Airport (SAN)\").\n   214→\n   215→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete shows no results for invalid query\n   216→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   217→- **Initial state**: Origin field is focused\n   218→- **Action**: User types \"xyznonexistent\" into the origin field\n   219→- **Expected**: The suggestion dropdown shows a \"No airports found\" message or similar empty state.\n   220→\n   221→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete destination works after using origin\n   222→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   223→- **Initial state**: Origin is set to \"LAX\"\n   224→- **Action**: User clicks the destination field and types \"New York\"\n   225→- **Expected**: Suggestions appear for New York area airports. Selecting one populates the destination. Both origin and destination retain their values.\n   226→\n   227→#### Test: AirportAutocomplete can be used repeatedly\n   228→- **Components**: AirportAutocomplete\n   229→- **Initial state**: Origin and destination are both populated\n   230→- **Action**: User clears origin, types a new airport, selects it, then clears destination, types a new airport, and selects it\n   231→- **Expected**: Both fields update correctly. Autocomplete suggestions work properly on each subsequent use.\n   232→\n   233→### DatePicker\n   234→\n   235→#### Test: DatePicker departure field shows placeholder\n   236→- **Components**: DatePicker\n   237→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with no date selected\n   238→- **Action**: User observes the departure date picker\n   239→- **Expected**: The departure date field shows a placeholder (e.g., \"Departure\" or a date format hint).\n   240→\n   241→#### Test: DatePicker return field shows placeholder when Round trip\n   242→- **Components**: DatePicker, TripTypeSelector\n   243→- **Initial state**: Search page loads with \"Round trip\" selected\n   244→- **Action**: User observes the return date picker\n   245→- **Expected**: The return date field is visible and shows a placeholder (e.g., \"Return\" or a date format hint).\n   246→\n   247→#### Test: DatePicker opens calendar on departure field click\n   248→- **Components**: DatePicker\n   249→- **Initial state**: Search page loaded, departure date field is not focused\n   250→- **Action**: User clicks the departure date field\n   251→- **Expected**: A calendar popup opens showing the current month. Past dates are disabled/grayed out. Users can navigate between months.\n   252→\n   253→#### Test: DatePicker selects a departure date\n   254→- **Components**: DatePicker\n   255→- **Initial state**: Departure date calendar is open\n   256→- **Action**: User clicks a future date (e.g., March 25)\n   257→- **Expected**: The date is selected and displayed in the departure field (e.g., \"Mar 25\" or \"2026-03-25\"). The calendar closes or shifts focus to the return date."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GDbKVVhHDEVdo96WZANr5c","session_id":"017a600f-8002-4d2b-b132-157c88ddc0ca","uuid":"40241180-5014-4663-bfe8-874148b69317"}
