[2026-03-14T19:35:28.677Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GDbKVVhHDEVdo96WZANr5c","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile a comprehensive report with all the information you requested.\n\n## Google Flights App - Complete Analysis Report\n\n### 1. App Directory Name and Structure\n\n**App Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/`\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n```\nGoogleFlights/\n├── .env                          (Environment configuration)\n├── AppSpec.md                    (App specifications)\n├── eslint.config.js\n├── index.html\n├── package.json\n├── package-lock.json\n├── playwright.config.ts          (Playwright test configuration)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── vite.config.ts\n├── netlify.toml\n├── dist/                         (Build output)\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md                  (Complete test specifications - 87KB)\n├── logs/\n├── netlify/                      (Serverless functions)\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── airports.ts           (Search airports API)\n│       ├── bookings.ts\n│       ├── db.ts                 (Database connection)\n│       ├── explore-destinations.ts\n│       ├── flight-legs.ts\n│       ├── my-bookings.ts\n│       ├── popular-destinations.ts\n│       ├── recent-searches.ts\n│       ├── search-flights.ts\n│       └── tracked-routes.ts\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── schema.ts                 (Database schema initialization)\n│   └── seed-db.ts                (Database seeding with 50+ airports)\n├── src/\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── AirportAutocomplete.tsx         (Main component)\n│   │   ├── AirportAutocomplete.css         (Styling)\n│   │   ├── CabinClassSelector.tsx\n│   │   ├── DatePicker.tsx\n│   │   ├── FilterSidebar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   │   ├── PassengerCountSelector.tsx\n│   │   ├── PassengerForm.tsx\n│   │   ├── PopularDestinations.tsx\n│   │   ├── PriceBreakdown.tsx\n│   │   ├── RecentSearches.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchButton.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchSummaryBar.tsx\n│   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx\n│   │   ├── TrackPricesToggle.tsx\n│   │   └── TripTypeSelector.tsx\n│   ├── pages/\n│   │   ├── SearchPage.tsx                 (Contains swap button)\n│   │   ├── SearchPage.css\n│   │   ├── SearchResultsPage.tsx\n│   │   ├── FlightDetailsPage.tsx\n│   │   ├── MyTripsPage.tsx\n│   │   └── ExplorePage.tsx\n│   ├── slices/\n│   │   └── searchSlice.ts                 (Redux state management with swap logic)\n│   └── [other files]\n├── tests/\n│   ├── cabin-class-selector.spec.ts      (Existing test template)\n│   ├── passenger-count-selector.spec.ts  (Existing test template)\n│   ├── search-button.spec.ts             (Existing test template with helpers)\n│   ├── trip-type-selector.spec.ts        (Existing test template)\n│   └── [AirportAutocomplete.spec.ts - TO BE CREATED]\n└── node_modules/\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. AirportAutocomplete Test Specifications from docs/tests.md\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` (lines 159-231)\n\n**Test Cases (12 total):**\n\n1. **AirportAutocomplete origin field shows placeholder text**\n   - Components: AirportAutocomplete\n   - Initial state: Search page loads with empty origin field\n   - Action: User observes the origin airport field\n   - Expected: Field displays placeholder text (e.g., \"Where from?\")\n\n2. **AirportAutocomplete destination field shows placeholder text**\n   - Components: AirportAutocomplete\n   - Initial state: Search page loads with empty destination field\n   - Action: User observes the destination airport field\n   - Expected: Field displays placeholder text (e.g., \"Where to?\")\n\n3. **AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing airport name**\n   - Initial state: Origin field is focused and empty\n   - Action: User types \"Los Angeles\" into the origin field\n   - Expected: Dropdown appears showing matching airports with name and IATA code\n\n4. **AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing IATA code**\n   - Initial state: Origin field is focused and empty\n   - Action: User types \"JFK\" into the origin field\n   - Expected: Dropdown shows \"John F. Kennedy International Airport (JFK)\"\n\n5. **AirportAutocomplete shows suggestions when typing city name**\n   - Initial state: Destination field is focused and empty\n   - Action: User types \"London\" into the destination field\n   - Expected: Dropdown shows London-area airports (e.g., \"London Heathrow (LHR)\")\n\n6. **AirportAutocomplete selects a suggestion and populates the field**\n   - Initial state: User has typed \"Los\" in origin field, suggestions visible\n   - Action: User clicks on \"Los Angeles International Airport (LAX)\"\n   - Expected: Field populated with selected airport, dropdown closes\n\n7. **AirportAutocomplete swap button exchanges origin and destination** ⭐ KEY TEST\n   - Initial state: Origin is set to \"LAX\" and destination is set to \"JFK\"\n   - Action: User clicks the swap button between origin and destination fields\n   - Expected: Origin becomes \"JFK\" and destination becomes \"LAX\"\n\n8. **AirportAutocomplete swap button works with empty fields**\n   - Initial state: Origin is set to \"LAX\", destination is empty\n   - Action: User clicks the swap button\n   - Expected: Origin becomes empty, destination becomes \"LAX\"\n\n9. **AirportAutocomplete clears field and shows new suggestions**\n   - Initial state: Origin field has \"LAX\" selected\n   - Action: User clears origin field and types \"San\"\n   - Expected: Field clears, new suggestions appear (SFO, SAN)\n\n10. **AirportAutocomplete shows no results for invalid query**\n    - Initial state: Origin field is focused\n    - Action: User types \"xyznonexistent\" into the origin field\n    - Expected: Dropdown shows \"No airports found\" message\n\n11. **AirportAutocomplete destination works after using origin**\n    - Initial state: Origin is set to \"LAX\"\n    - Action: User clicks destination field and types \"New York\"\n    - Expected: Suggestions appear, selecting one populates destination\n\n12. **AirportAutocomplete can be used repeatedly**\n    - Initial state: Origin and destination are both populated\n    - Action: User clears and changes both fields multiple times\n    - Expected: Both fields update correctly on each use\n\n---\n\n### 3. AirportAutocomplete Component Source Code\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/AirportAutocomplete.tsx`\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Interface accepts: `value`, `onChange`, `placeholder`, `error`, `testIdPrefix`\n- Uses React hooks: `useState`, `useRef`, `useEffect`, `useCallback`\n- Debounced API calls (200ms) to `/api/airports?q={searchQuery}`\n- Manages state: query, suggestions, isOpen, isFocused, noResults\n- Click-outside detection to close dropdown\n- Display format: `${value.city} (${value.iata_code})`\n- Test IDs: `{testIdPrefix}-container`, `{testIdPrefix}-input`, `{testIdPrefix}-dropdown`, `{testIdPrefix}-suggestion-{iataCode}`, `{testIdPrefix}-no-results`, `{testIdPrefix}-error`\n- No results message: \"No airports found\"\n\n**Airport Data Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface Airport {\n  id: string\n  iata_code: string\n  name: string\n  city: string\n  country: string\n  latitude?: number\n  longitude?: number\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. Existing Test Files\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/`\n\n**Files:**\n1. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/cabin-class-selector.spec.ts` - 91 lines\n2. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/passenger-count-selector.spec.ts` - Sample template\n3. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/search-button.spec.ts` - 206 lines (with helper functions)\n4. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/trip-type-selector.spec.ts` - Sample template\n\n**Test Pattern Used:**\n```typescript\nimport { test, expect } from '@playwright/test'\n\ntest.describe('ComponentName', () => {\n  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {\n    await page.goto('/')\n    await expect(page.getByTestId('search-page')).toBeVisible({ timeout: 10000 })\n  })\n\n  test('Test name', async ({ page }) => {\n    // Test implementation\n  })\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Playwright Configuration\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Configuration:**\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60,000ms\n- Expect timeout: 10,000ms\n- Single worker (sequential execution)\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Reporter: List + JSON\n- Browser: Chromium with Replay.io integration\n- Web server: Netlify dev server on port 8888\n- Commands: `npx netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n- Server reuse: true (except in CI)\n\n---\n\n### 6. Database Schema & Seed Data for Airports\n\n**Schema Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/schema.ts`\n\n**Airports Table Definition:**\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS airports (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  iata_code VARCHAR(3) UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  city TEXT NOT NULL,\n  country TEXT NOT NULL,\n  latitude DECIMAL,\n  longitude DECIMAL,\n  timezone TEXT\n)\n\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_airports_iata ON airports(iata_code)\n```\n\n**Seed Data Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts` (lines 9-62)\n\n**50 Major International Airports Seeded:**\n\nUS Airports (15):\n- LAX, JFK, SFO, ORD, ATL, DFW, DEN, SEA, MIA, BOS, LAS, MCO, IAH, PHX, MSP\n\nEurope (9):\n- LHR, LGW, CDG, FRA, AMS, MAD, FCO, MUC, ZRH\n\nMiddle East & Asia-Pacific (15):\n- IST, DXB, DOH, SIN, HKG, NRT, HND, ICN, BKK, DEL, BOM, PEK, PVG, SYD, MEL\n\nAmericas & Other (11):\n- AKL, GRU, MEX, SCL, EZE, JNB, CAI, CPT, YYZ, YVR, HNL\n\nEach includes: IATA code, full name, city, country, latitude, longitude, timezone\n\n**API Endpoint for Airport Search:**\n\nLocation: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/airports.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- Endpoint: GET /api/airports?q={searchQuery}\n- Searches: name ILIKE %, city ILIKE %, iata_code ILIKE %\n- Returns: Up to 10 results\n- Fields: id, iata_code, name, city, country, latitude, longitude\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. Swap Button & Related Components\n\n**Swap Button Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx` (lines 50-57)\n\n**Implementation:**\n```typescript\n<button\n  className=\"search-page__swap-btn\"\n  onClick={() => dispatch(swapAirports())}\n  data-testid=\"swap-airports-button\"\n  title=\"Swap origin and destination\"\n>\n  ⇄\n</button>\n```\n\n**Swap Action Logic:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/searchSlice.ts` (lines 151-155)\n\n```typescript\nswapAirports(state) {\n  const temp = state.origin\n  state.origin = state.destination\n  state.destination = temp\n}\n```\n\n**Swap Button CSS:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchPage.css` (lines 49-69)\n\n```css\n.search-page__swap-btn {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 40px;\n  height: 48px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-full);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--color-text-secondary);\n  background: var(--color-surface);\n  transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\n.search-page__swap-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--color-primary-light);\n  border-color: var(--color-primary);\n  color: var(--color-primary);\n}\n```\n\n**Airport Integration in SearchPage:**\n\n```typescript\n// Origin field (lines 43-49)\n<AirportAutocomplete\n  value={origin}\n  onChange={(airport) => dispatch(setOrigin(airport))}\n  placeholder=\"Where from?\"\n  error={validationErrors['origin']}\n  testIdPrefix=\"origin\"\n/>\n\n// Swap button in between (lines 50-57)\n\n// Destination field (lines 58-64)\n<AirportAutocomplete\n  value={destination}\n  onChange={(airport) => dispatch(setDestination(airport))}\n  placeholder=\"Where to?\"\n  error={validationErrors['destination']}\n  testIdPrefix=\"destination\"\n/>\n```\n\n**Redux Actions Used:** `setOrigin`, `setDestination`, `swapAirports` (exported from searchSlice)\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Key Files\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/AirportAutocomplete.tsx` | 142 | Main component implementation |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/AirportAutocomplete.css` | 91 | Component styling |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx` | 102 | Integration with swap button |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchPage.css` | 90 | Swap button and layout styling |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/searchSlice.ts` | 213 | Redux state (Airport interface, swapAirports action) |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/airports.ts` | 26 | API endpoint for airport search |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/schema.ts` | 163 | Database schema with airports table |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts` | 319 | 50+ airport seed data |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md` | 87KB | 12 test specifications for AirportAutocomplete |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts` | 32 | Playwright test configuration |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/cabin-class-selector.spec.ts` | 92 | Test template reference |\n| `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/search-button.spec.ts` | 206 | Test template with helpers |"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aadb98c451f9186a8 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 54488\ntool_uses: 25\nduration_ms: 96399</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"017a600f-8002-4d2b-b132-157c88ddc0ca","uuid":"1ecb7b0f-5273-4063-905e-54c65bfefbe6","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the Google Flights app in /repo/apps/. I need:\n1. The app directory name and structure (ls the app dir)\n2. The docs/tests.md file content for the AirportAutocomplete test entries\n3. The AirportAutocomplete component source code\n4. Any existing test files (*.spec.ts)\n5. The playwright.config.ts\n6. The seed data or database schema related to airports\n7. Any swap button or related com